12 L122:   * cite66†Pull requests 597 L123:   * cite67†Discussions L124:   * cite68†Actions L125:   * cite69†Projects L126:   * cite70†Security and quality 5 L127:   * cite71†Insights L128: \nL129: Additional navigation options\nL130: # v0.1.4.post1\nL131: \nL132: Compare\nL133: \nL134: # Choose a tag to compare\nL135: \nL136: ## Sorry, something went wrong.\nL137: \nL138: Filter\nL139: \nL140: Loading [Input]\nL141: \nL142: ## Sorry, something went wrong.\nL143: \nL144: ### Uh oh!\nL145: \nL146: There was an error while loading. Please reload this page.\nL147: ## No results found\nL148: \nL149: cite72†View all tags L150: \nL151: cite73†Image: @Re-bin†avatars.githubusercontent.com cite74†Re-bin released this 21 Feb 13:09\nL152: \nL153: · cite75†4097 commits to main since this release\nL154: \nL155: cite64†v0.1.4.post1 L156: \nL157: cite76†`af71ccf` L158: \nL159: 🎉 Another big release from the 🐈 nanobot community — thanks to all contributors, especially our 19 new ones!\nL160: This release brings major channel improvements across Feishu, Slack, and Discord, a new provider, prompt caching, and a significant agent loop refactor. More reliable, more capable, leaner code 😄.\nL161: ## Highlights\nL162:   * Feishu Media — Bot can now send and receive images, audio, and files (cite77†#844 , cite78†#922 )\nL163:   * Slack Media Upload — Send files directly from the agent (cite79†#904 )\nL164:   * Discord Long Messages — Automatically splits messages exceeding 2000 characters (cite80†#900 )\nL165:   * VolcEngine Provider — New LLM provider support (cite81†#812 )\nL166:   * Prompt Caching — Anthropic and OpenRouter cache_control support for lower costs (cite82†#854 , cite83†#905 )\nL167:   * MCP Auth Headers — Custom HTTP headers for authenticated MCP servers (cite84†#807 )\nL168:   * Telegram Improvements — Configurable reply-to behavior, /help bypasses ACL (cite85†#879 , cite86†#824 )\nL169:   * CLI Subagent Support — CLI now routes through message bus, enabling full subagent support (cite87†#908 )\nL170:   * Reliable Memory — Memory consolidation uses structured tool calls instead of fragile JSON parsing (cite88†#866 )\nL171:   * Leaner Agent Loop — Extracted memory logic, merged redundant methods, -31% lines (cite89†#930 )\nL172:   * Smarter File Editing — edit_file now shows a diff when old_text doesn't match (cite90†#921 )\nL173:   * Bug Fixes — MCP reconnection, session key persistence, duplicate replies, cron execution, and more (cite91†#892 , cite92†#902 , cite93†#832 , cite94†#821 , cite95†#823 , ...)\nL174: ## What's Changed\nL175:   * feat(feishu): support sending images, audio, and files by cite96†@KinglittleQ in cite77†#844 L176:   * fix: Codex provider routing for GitHub Copilot models by cite97†@Molunerfinn in cite98†#836 L177:   * fix: wait for killed process after shell timeout to prevent fd leaks by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite100†#851 L178:   * Fix safety guard false positive on 'format' in URLs by cite101†@rubychilds in cite102†#820 L179:   * fix: remove dead pub/sub code from MessageBus by cite103†@AlexanderMerkel in cite104†#870 L180:   * fix: use loguru native formatting to prevent KeyError on curly braces by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite105†#864 L181:   * Fix: Add UTF-8 encoding and unicode support for JSON output by cite106†@chtangwin in cite107†#455 L182:   * fix(tools): resolve relative file paths against workspace by cite108†@omdv in cite109†#653 L183:   * fix(cron): validate timezone inputs when adding jobs by cite110†@Athemis in cite111†#763 L184:   * fix(agent): handle non-string values in memory consolidation by cite112†@jswxharry in cite113†#644 L185:   * feat: add Anthropic prompt caching via cache_control by cite114†@tercerapersona in cite82†#854 L186:   * fix: allow retry for models that send interim text before tool calls by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite115†#825 L187:   * fix: prevent duplicate memory consolidation tasks per session by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite95†#823 L188:   * fix: /help command bypasses ACL on Telegram by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite86†#824 L189:   * feat: Add VolcEngine LLM provider support by cite116†@init-new-world in cite81†#812 L190:   * feature: Added custom headers for MCP Auth use. by cite117†@dxtime in cite84†#807 L191:   * feat: Agent is able to reply to original message (Telegram Channel) by cite118†@DaryeDev in cite119†#815 L192:   * fix: make cron run command actually execute the agent by cite120†@ClaytonWWilson in cite94†#821 L193:   * feat: make Telegram reply-to-message behavior configurable, default false by cite74†@Re-bin in cite85†#879 L194:   * fix: fixed not logging tool uses if a think fragment had them attached. by cite118†@DaryeDev in cite121†#833 L195:   * fix: Resolve \"Unrecognized chat message\" error for StepFun and strict providers by cite122†@Tevkanbot in cite123†#795 L196:   * feat: add OpenRouter prompt caching via cache_control by cite114†@tercerapersona in cite83†#905 L197:   * feat(slack): add media file upload support by cite124†@pjbakker in cite79†#904 L198:   * fix: convert remaining f-string logger calls to loguru native format by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite125†#903 L199:   * fix: split Discord messages exceeding 2000-character limit by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite80†#900 L200:   * fix: store session key in metadata to avoid lossy filename reconstruction by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite92†#902 L201:   * fix(agent): avoid duplicate email replies when message tool already sends by cite126†@KimGLee in cite93†#832 L202:   * fix: allow MCP reconnection after transient failure by cite99†@nikolasdehor in cite91†#892 L203:   * refactor: route CLI interactive mode through message bus by cite74†@Re-bin in cite87†#908 L204:   * feat(feishu): add mult